+config BT_MT6797
+	tristate "MediaTek MT6797 CONSYS Bluetooth (experimental)"
+	depends on MTK_MT6797_CONSYS
+	help
+	  Experimental HCI driver for the Bluetooth controller in the MT6797
+	  connectivity subsystem. Packets travel as H:4 over STP task 0 on
+	  the CONSYS persistent link, which the CONSYS owner starts after a
+	  successful WMT negotiation when its device tree selects it.
+
